 "remarks": "Moments from the beach in one of Old Greenwich's most distinctive concierge residences. Sun-filled and sophisticated, this beautifully appointed three-bedroom blends timeless Shore Colonial character with effortless, turnkey living. An open floor plan is enhanced by handcrafted millwork, hardwood floors and signature custom windows, while the bright kitchen flows seamlessly into the living room with fireplace and French doors overlooking the peaceful grounds. Exceptional amenities elevate the lifestyle, including a door person, water-view rooftop terrace, entertaining and wine-tasting room with stone fireplace, personal wine locker, catering kitchen, fitness room, outdoor grills and dining terrace, plus two assigned parking spaces. Just seconds from Tod's Point beaches and nature preserve and close to the shops, restaurants and train in Old Greenwich Village, this is a rare opportunity to enjoy sophisticated, low-maintenance coastal living, equally ideal as a full-time or part-time residence.",
